  unitName: Goddess Svafa (EU)
  unitId: 720115
  unitNumber: 7025
  description: Part of the pantheon of fierce warriors coming from the coldest territories
    of Grand Gaia. Their legend tells us that 6 exceptional semi-goddesses select
    among the best of dying combatants, whom would be granted the right to enter
    their heaven and fight side by side with the gods. Svafa is now the real embodiment
    of the power of the seas. She can call at will any creatures of the abbyss and
    unleash their wrath.
  summonDesc: 
  fusionDesc: I feel the strength of the seas.
  evoDesc: I just came back from the abbyss. Will you met my new friend?
